+     reads. Ghidra typed them undefined4 (unsigned), so `>> 0x10` zero-extended: negative
+     corner components (see table @0x7959a8: -75,-160,...) became huge positives, the GTE
+     clamped all four screen corners to the same point -> every skidmark quad drawn
+     DEGENERATE at one pixel while the reference draws real trapezoids (the cf49+ shadow-
+     trapezoid fb divergence of the L9 attract race). All 11 packed locals cast (int). */
   undefined1 uVar1;
   undefined4 uVar2;
   uint uVar3;
